# The repository's root .gitignore excludes `.env` everywhere (developer secrets must never be
# committed). Template `.env` files are the exception: they are committed CONFIG, not secrets —
# they hold only {{BASE_URL}} / {{USERNAME}} / {{PASSWORD}} placeholders that the seeder ingests
# and BootstrapperEngine.generate_project fills in per project. They MUST ship so a fresh clone
# can seed complete templates. Re-include them here (a .gitignore in this directory overrides the
# root one for paths beneath it).
!.env
